This directory contains test suites for the Garden Sensors firmware.

## Test Layout

- test_desktop/: host-native tests for pure logic (no Arduino hardware dependencies).
- test_device/: optional on-device integration/sanity checks.

## Required Verification Commands

Run embedded profile builds:

~/.platformio/penv/bin/platformio run -e node_soil_probe_prone -e node_soil_probe_prone_only -e node_sht31 -e node_combo -e node_soil_capacitive

Run native unit tests:

~/.platformio/penv/bin/platformio test -e native

## Notes

- Add logic tests to test_desktop when introducing or changing pure helper functions.
- Keep hardware-dependent behavior behind compile-time flags in src/main.cpp.
- If a new node profile is added in platformio.ini, update the embedded build command list above.
